Fork additions

The data-plane additions are the fork's own work, released under the same MIT
terms: CSV import with free-form custom fields (`crm import`), row export
(`crm rows`), import batch provenance (internal/db/migrations/002_imports.sql),
the packages internal/csvio and internal/importer, and the related CLI and
repository code (internal/cli/import.go, internal/cli/rows.go,
internal/cli/custom_fields.go, internal/db/repo/import.go,
internal/db/repo/custom_field.go).
